  "entry": "code/earth_intelligence_platform/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Enter a city to define an area of interest, then run engines in sequence that pull public satellite, DEM, weather and land-cover data for it, ending in a multi-hazard risk assessment and one combined environmental intelligence score. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
